* * in a dc list is the statement's start in r68, also after a string element (dc.w "xy",L-*-4):
* the string's length, rounded up to the element size, is counted.
* fixed: b0a664a 2026-10-11 r68togas: * after a string in a dc list
* expect text: 7879001c 0001001c 00070008 00006162 63126162 6300000e 61620000 00000008 4e714e71
 psect dc_star_string,0,0,0,0,0
E dc.w "xy",L-*-4
 dc.w 1,L-*
 dc.w 7,8,*
 dc.b "abc",L-*
 dc.w "abc",L-*
 dc.l "ab",L-*
L nop
 ends
